{"slug":"Falkland_Islands","title":"Falkland Islands","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Map_nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Map_data","text":"Map data","level":2},{"id":"Technical","text":"Technical","level":2}],"html":"<p><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Map</a> of the <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">Falkland Islands</span> located outside of Argentina.\n</p><p>It consists of two main islands, surrounded by water on all sides. There are plenty of tiny islands scattered around the main islands.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/Falkland_Islands_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"2100\" data-file-height=\"1400\"><figcaption>The Falkland Islands map, from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/falklandislands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_nations\">Nations</h2></div>\n<p>The map features 12 named <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nations</a>, including Albermarle, Weddell, Fox Bay, East Falkland, Saunders and Dunbar and South Lefonia.</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_data\">Map data</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Categories:</b> South America</li>\n<li><b>Nations:</b> 12</li>\n<li><b>Public rotation frequency:</b> 4</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Technical\">Technical</h2></div>\n<p>The size of the <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> is 2100 x 1400.\n<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Maps</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\" aria-label=\"Jump up\" title=\"Jump up\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>","section":"Maps"}
